"settings.voice.dictation.postProcess.body" = "After Whisper transcribes your dictation, Tippi sends the raw text through your active LLM provider to remove language-aware filler words (German/English/Spanish/French/Japanese, without confusing them with real words like English \"also\"), remove hesitation repeats, add punctuation and correct capitalization (including German nouns), and fix obvious self-corrections. Only runs on inputs ≥ 50 characters (shorter texts do not benefit). If the AI responds conversationally instead of cleaning, the raw transcript is inserted. Adds 1–3 s of latency — dictation never breaks.";
